Some notices for you who would like to hack the source in order to
improve powwow, fix bugs or just have fun:

* Follow AGENTS.md in the top directory. Despite its name, it is for all
  contributors: it gives the coding conventions, and how to test, document
  and commit a change.

* Run "make -C doc update-unicode" to download the latest Unicode data and
  make doc/unicode-names.txt and doc/emoji-names.txt again, the names that
  C-x 8 Ret, C-x 8 e e and \N{...} look up. It runs doc/update-unicode.sh,
  which checks the new files before it replaces the old ones. Commit them.

* Please send your changes as pull requests to https://github.com/MUME/powwow.
